# Topic-specific perspectives. Existing dedicated grief, romance and safety paths remain separate.
# Exclusive reflection modes are derived from the live mood, effective personality, relationship and thread depth.
# Topic-specific reasons and follow-up questions are authored, not arbitrary word substitution.

